<title>USA: Halifax Corp completes asset purchase.</title>
<headline>Halifax Corp completes asset purchase.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Corp said on Tuesday it concluded the asset purchase of the ongoing computer integration business of Consolidated Computer Investors Inc.</p>
<p>The operations will merge into and operate as a division of the company's wholly-owned subsidiary CMS Automation Inc.</p>
<p>Halifax was trading down 1/8 at 18-5/8 minutes following the market open.</p>
